            "answer": {
              "short": "$\\frac{29}{100}$",
              "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}P(\\text{blue eyes})&=\\frac{25+9+6+18}{200}\\\\P(\\text{blue eyes})&=\\frac{58}{200}\\\\P(\\text{blue eyes})&=\\frac{29}{100}\\end{align*}$$",
