            "answer": {
              "short": "$\\frac{23}{100}$",
              "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}P(\\text{red hair})&=\\frac{6+18+22}{200}\\\\P(\\text{red hair})&=\\frac{46}{200}\\\\P(\\text{red hair})&=\\frac{23}{100}\\end{align*}$$",
